Current Project Structure
------------------------------------------------------------

Presentation

    TMainForm

        │

        ▼

Application

    TMView

        │

        ├── TConfig
        ├── TNavigator
        ├── TMediaLoader
        └── TRenderer

------------------------------------------------------------
Planned Next Session
------------------------------------------------------------

1. Implement TConfig.Load() and Save().

2. Introduce typed enumerations in uTypes
   (TFitMode, TInterpolationMode, etc.).

3. Replace string configuration values with
   strongly typed properties.

4. Begin the first renderer implementation.

5. Display the first image through the complete
